"description":"The tree of the content cards of a layout (docs/spec/exposure.md#window-snapshot). Each case gives the stored slicing tree of a space layout, {root} (packages/soksak/docs/layout.md#the-model); a card whose id is a window side (left, right, top, bottom) is a place card and is outside the tree. root is the tree that the page and the workbench of the mygo host derive: a split is {direction, size, children} and a card is {card, size}; frame and tabs of a card are not part of a case, because they depend on the plane size and the tab data. A cut along x is a row and a cut along y a column; size values are compared within a relative 1e-9.",
"cases":[
 {"name":"single card","layout":{"root":{"card":"main"}},"root":{"card":"main","size":1}},
